gapY(){return"Switch between Team view \u2014 the schedule of everyone who reports to you \u2014 and Colleagues view, where you draft your own shifts alongside your peers."},
gaZ8(){return"Schedule Views"},
gaZ7(){return"Look at the same week four ways: Weekly grid, a Daily timeline, a Monthly calendar, and My Schedule for your own shifts."},
gapF(){return"Navigate & Filter"},
gapE(){return"Use Today and the arrows to move between weeks, then narrow the team by department, location, or reporting scope (direct, indirect, or both)."},
gapD(){return"Copy Last Week"},
gapC(){return"Reuse last week's plan in one step \u2014 it copies shifts into any empty days for the current week, skipping days that are already filled."},
gapR(){return"Publish the Week"},
gapQ(){return"Turn your drafts into the official schedule. Once every cell is filled the button turns blue; publishing notifies the affected employees. It stays disabled while empty cells remain."},
