gapB(){return"Assign a Shift"},
gapA(){return"Tap any empty cell to open the shift editor and set the times, or tap an existing shift to edit it. Conflicts (rest gaps, leave overlaps) are flagged automatically."},
gapP(){return"Select Multiple Cells"},
gapO(){return"Need the same shift across several people or days? Drag across the grid \u2014 or long-press then tap \u2014 to select many cells, then assign them all at once from the bar that appears."},
gapX(){return"Reusable Templates"},
gapW(){return"In the shift editor, tick 'Save as template' and give it a name to store a shift you use often. Next time it appears as a chip you can apply in one tap."},
gapV(){return"Swaps, Conflicts & Time Off"},
gapU(){return"The side panel collects swap requests to approve or decline, scheduling conflicts to resolve, and your team's approved time off \u2014 all in one place."},
